  "bio": "Bsv Lamachineinfernale is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for their unique dotwork and geometric styles. They create impressive body ornaments and full black tattoos with confident strokes and intricate patterns, reflecting their mastery in their craft. Their work, sponsored by well-known brands such as Monster Energy, Killer Ink Tattoo, and Balm Tattoo, displays their significant standing in the tattoo industry.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\n▪️𝗗𝗢𝗧𝗪𝗢𝗥𝗞 /𝗕𝗢𝗗𝗬 𝗢𝗥𝗡𝗔𝗠𝗘𝗡𝗧𝗦 /𝗕𝗟𝗔𝗖𝗞𝗢𝗨𝗧▪️\nᴡᴏʀᴋɪɴɢ @\n@lamachineinfernaletattoo \nꜱᴘᴏɴꜱᴏʀᴇᴅ ʙʏ\n@monsterenergy \n@killerinktattoo \n@balm_tattoo",
